  m_OnCullStateChanged:
    m_PersistentCalls:
      m_Calls: []
  m_text: "<b>Goz-AR v1.0</b>\n\nan Augmenter Reality game demo \ndeveloped in Unity
    with AR-Foundation / AR-Core and built for Android.\n\n---\n\nIt was supposed
    to be a completely different / much lamer project which sank in its own flatulence.\n\n---\n\nThis
    is not a complete game but just a demo to showcase few AR capabilities. \nIt
    is my first PlayStore publication. \nPlease ... be gentle with me :)\n\nIf you
    have any suggestions for improvement or complaints or whatever, email me.\n\nIf
    you wish to participate in further developments of this or any next project,
    email me.\n\nIf you feel like you have an idea for the next 1 Billion Dollar
    mobile game, email me.\n\nMy email:   pepposmart@gmail.com \nMy GitHub:   ...\n\nSpecial
    thanks to Lele & Max.\n"
